.TH TAKEOVER_IP 8 "June 2014" "Xsan File System"
.SH NAME
takeover_ip \- broadcast virtual IP information for Xsan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.na
.nh
.HP
.B /System/Library/Filesystems/acfs.fs/Contents/lib/takeover_ip
.BI -d \ device_name
.BI -m \ mac_address
.BI -i \ ipv4_ip
.ad
.hy
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtakeover_ip\fR provides a mechanism for sending a gratuitous arp
reply when the secondary node in an HA pair takes over as primary and
activates the configured virtual IPs (VIPs).
.PP
This is typically used by the startup/shutdown scripts, not by an administrator.
Only use when recommended by Apple Support.
